# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 构建产物补充 (2026-10-05)
#
# 上面几节覆盖了 Delphi 与 Lazarus 的常见产物, 但有两类东西会持续污染
# `git status`, 而它们都不是源码。
#
# IMPORTANT -- gitignore 对已追踪文件无效
# -----------------------------------------
# 本仓库有 42 个文件已被 git 追踪, 同时又命中下面某条规则 (38 个 .dproj /
# .res / .a / .rc, 以及 4 个真正的产物: main.o / Packman.cfg /
# ClassBrowsing.cfg / Demo1.lps)。gitignore 不会把它们移出版本库, 需要
# `git rm --cached <path>` 才行。
#
# 这里【不动】那些文件, 理由是:
#   * .dproj / .res / .libshlwapi.a / resource.rc 属工程资产而非产物 --
#     vendored VCL 子包的 .res 是 Delphi 编译必需, .dproj 是工程配置。
#     把它们从版本库剔除会让 vendored 树无法直接编译。
#   * 4 个真产物应该单独做一次 `git rm --cached`, 那是一次有意的、需要在
#     提交信息里说明的改动, 不该混在一次忽略规则调整里悄悄发生。
#
# 所以本次只做"防止新的产物进来"。既有 42 个文件的去留是独立议题。

# 链接器 / 编译器中间产物
*.obj
*.o
*.dcu
*.bpl
*.dcp
*.map
*.drc
*.tds
*.idb
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.lib
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll

# Lazarus / Free Pascal
**/lib/
**/units/
**/*.lps
**/*.lpi.bak
**/*.compiled
**/*.ppu
**/*.ppudata
**/*.rst
**/*.or
**/*.a
Tests/FpcCoreTests/FpcCoreTests
Tests/FpcCoreTests/FpcCoreTests.exe
# The SVG probes link the whole LCL, so each binary is ~3 MB. They are built
# from source by tools/build_svg_probe.ps1 (and by the lcl-svg-runtime CI job);
# committing them would add ~12 MB of rebuildable output to the tree.
Tests/FpcCoreTests/svg/*.exe
# The form probes link the same LCL and for the same reason (tools/build_form_probe.ps1,
# and the lcl-svg-runtime CI job).
Tests/FpcCoreTests/forms/*.exe
# ImgCollProbe links the same LCL too, and is built by the SAME script as the two
# groups above (tools/build_svg_probe.ps1 builds all eight probes). Its line was
# simply never added when the probe was introduced, so it was the one binary in
# this tree that `git status` would have offered to commit: a ~3 MB rebuildable
# artefact, produced by a command already in CI.
Tests/FpcCoreTests/imgcoll/*.exe
# SynRcProbe links the same LCL and is built by tools/build_syn_probe.ps1, for the
# same reason as the three groups above.
Tests/FpcCoreTests/syn/*.exe
# Its captured output. `*.err` was already ignored, which left out.txt as the one
# untracked file a probe run leaves behind in every other probe directory.
Tests/FpcCoreTests/syn/out.txt

